{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following PyPy 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original PyPy 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport sys\ninput = sys.stdin.readline\n\ndef create_tree_capacity(n):\n    capacity = 1\n    while capacity < n:\n        capacity <<= 1\n    return [0] * (capacity << 1)\n\ndef point_update(tree, idx, val):\n    pos = idx + len(tree) >> 1\n    tree[pos] = val\n    while pos:\n        pos >>= 1\n        tree[pos] = tree[pos << 1] + tree[(pos << 1) | 1]\n\ndef interval_sum(tree, l, r):\n    offset = len(tree) >> 1\n    l += offset\n    r += offset\n    res = 0\n    while l <= r:\n        if l & 1:\n            res += tree[l]\n            l += 1\n        if not r & 1:\n            res += tree[r]\n            r -= 1\n        l >>= 1\n        r >>= 1\n    return res\n\ndef factorize(n):\n    res = []\n    d = 2\n    while d * d <= n:\n        while n % d == 0:\n            res.append(d)\n            n //= d\n        d += 1\n    if n > 1:\n        res.append(n)\n    return res\n\ndef totient(n):\n    factors = set(factorize(n))\n    value = n\n    for p in factors:\n        value = value // p * (p - 1)\n    return value\n\ndef product_mod(a, b, m):\n    result = 1\n    for i in range(a + 1, b + 1):\n        result = (result * i) % m\n    return result\n\nn, mod = map(int, input().split())\nphi = totient(mod)\nN = n + 5\nfact = [1] * (N + 1)\nfor i in range(1, N + 1):\n    fact[i] = (i * fact[i - 1]) % mod\n\nif n <= 3:\n    print(0)\nelse:\n    dp = [0] * 2000\n    dp[0], dp[1], dp[2], dp[3] = 1, 2, 2, 1\n    seg = create_tree_capacity(2005)\n    for i in range(4):\n        point_update(seg, i, dp[i])\n    max_pos = 3\n    answer = 0\n    for step in range(n - 3):\n        old = dp[:]\n        temp_sum = 0\n        for j in range(step + 3):\n            for k in range(1, max_pos + 2):\n                s = interval_sum(seg, j + k + 1, 2004)\n                temp_sum = (temp_sum + s * old[k - 1]) % mod\n                dp[j + k] = (dp[j + k] + old[k - 1]) % mod\n                point_update(seg, j + k, dp[j + k])\n        max_pos += step + 3\n        prod = product_mod(step + 3, n, mod)\n        answer = (answer + prod * temp_sum) % mod\n    print(answer)\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        String[] firstLine = br.readLine().split(\" \");\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(firstLine[0]);\n        int mod = Integer.parseInt(firstLine[1]);\n        \n        int phi = totient(mod);\n        int N = n + 5;\n        long[] fact = new long[N + 1];\n        fact[0] = 1;\n        for (int i = 1; i <= N; i++) {\n            fact[i] = (i * fact[i - 1]) % mod;\n        }\n\n        if (n <= 3) {\n            System.out.println(0);\n        } else {\n            long[] dp = new long[2000];\n            dp[0] = 1;\n            dp[1] = 2;\n            dp[2] = 2;\n            dp[3] = 1;\n            \n            long[] seg = create_tree_capacity(2005);\n            for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n                point_update(seg, i, (int)dp[i]);\n            }\n            \n            int max_pos = 3;\n            long answer = 0;\n            \n            for (int step = 0; step < n - 3; step++) {\n                long[] old = dp.clone();\n                long temp_sum = 0;\n                \n                for (int j = 0; j < step + 3; j++) {\n                    for (int k = 1; k <= max_pos + 2; k++) {\n                        long s = interval_sum(seg, j + k + 1, 2004);\n                        temp_sum = (temp_sum + s * old[k - 1]) % mod;\n                        dp[j + k] = (dp[j + k] + old[k - 1]) % mod;\n                        point_update(seg, j + k, (int)dp[j + k]);\n                    }\n                }\n                \n                max_pos += step + 3;\n                long prod = product_mod(step + 3, n, mod);\n                answer = (answer + prod * temp_sum) % mod;\n            }\n            \n            System.out.println(answer);\n        }\n    }\n\n    private static long[] create_tree_capacity(int n) {\n        int capacity = 1;\n        while (capacity < n) {\n            capacity <<= 1;\n        }\n        return new long[capacity << 1];\n    }\n\n    private static void point_update(long[] tree, int idx, int val) {\n        int pos = (idx + tree.length) >> 1;\n        tree[pos] = val;\n        while (pos > 0) {\n            pos >>= 1;\n            tree[pos] = tree[pos << 1] + tree[(pos << 1) | 1];\n        }\n    }\n\n    private static long interval_sum(long[] tree, int l, int r) {\n        int offset = tree.length >> 1;\n        l += offset;\n        r += offset;\n        long res = 0;\n        while (l <= r) {\n            if ((l & 1) == 1) {\n                res += tree[l];\n                l += 1;\n            }\n            if ((r & 1) == 0) {\n                res += tree[r];\n                r -= 1;\n            }\n            l >>= 1;\n            r >>= 1;\n        }\n        return res;\n    }\n\n    private static List<Integer> factorize(int n) {\n        List<Integer> res = new ArrayList<>();\n        int d = 2;\n        while (d * d <= n) {\n            while (n % d == 0) {\n                res.add(d);\n                n /= d;\n            }\n            d++;\n        }\n        if (n > 1) {\n            res.add(n);\n        }\n        return res;\n    }\n\n    private static int totient(int n) {\n        List<Integer> factors = factorize(n);\n        Set<Integer> factorSet = new HashSet<>(factors);\n        int value = n;\n        for (int p : factorSet) {\n            value = value / p * (p - 1);\n        }\n        return value;\n    }\n\n    private static long product_mod(int a, int b, int m) {\n        long result = 1;\n        for (int i = a + 1; i <= b; i++) {\n            result = (result * i) % m;\n        }\n        return result;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.75\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-9.917721035890281e-05, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.00015496007108595222, -3.2305197237292305e-05, -0.4741036295890808, -0.0033384801354259253, -3.933898824470816e-06, -5.245195097813848e-06, -1.4305104514278355e-06, -0.0017301365733146667, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -4.6132929128361866e-05, -0.2519379258155823, -0.0002623452164698392, -0.20360539853572845, -5.125986263010418e-06, -0.0016847953666001558, -4.529942543740617e-06, -2.622600959512056e-06, -4.768360213347478e-06, -3.4927710657939315e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.2255021631717682, -0.08898624032735825, -9.536738616588991e-07, -2.3841830625315197e-06, -8.713819261174649e-05, -0.0001515035255579278, -8.344646857949556e-07, -9.536738616588991e-07, -5.960446742392378e-06, -7.986990567587782e-06, -1.0132738680113107e-05, -3.6000557884108275e-05, -8.940656698541716e-06, -7.867782187531702e-06, -9.536738616588991e-07, -0.22864103317260742, -2.50339189733495e-06, -0.4678555130958557, -0